Fukiko (Magical Meow Meow Girl)
===============================

*"In the memory of my mother, I'll be just like my favorite magical girls!"*

*A young magical girl channeling her late mother's power, guided by her feline companion Azyrus.*

**Background**

Raised on shoujo manga, Fukiko never expected her own fantasies
to come true -- until a strange winged cat named Azyrus appeared
at her window one night and revealed that her late mother had
secretly been a magical crime fighter. Fukiko's locket, a
keepsake from her mother, turned out to hold that same power,
and so the heroine Lovely Savior Myu Myu was born.

**Personality**

Strong-willed and naive, Fukiko expects the world to play fair by
her own rules. That same faith lets her see the good in bad
situations, though her childish streak can also mean a fair
amount of whining.

