**Azyrus** -- **Attributes:** Flight +2, Quick +1, Smart +2; Awkward Size −1 (Small), Frail −1, Short-Tempered −1.

**Notes**

**Lovely Savior Myu Myu** -- Clutching her locket and shouting her transformation phrase
turns Fukiko into her cat-themed magical-girl form, right
down to a bell collar and a whole new outfit -- villains seem
oddly willing to wait out the sequence. She can also use this
power just to change her appearance, but not while also using
Shape-Shifter.

**Azyrus** -- Beneath his cute exterior, Azyrus is a steady source of
advice for Fukiko, even when her naivete exasperates him.

